{"sections":[{"type":"Meta","title":"Which skills are employers seeking in your area?","description":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts ","contentTitle":"Title for google analytics","releaseDate":"2023-01-01","lastUpdated":"2023-01-01","outputSeries":"slugforoutputseries","contentType":"robo-journalism"},{"type":"Twisty","title":"These are \"statistics in development\". Learn more here.","content":"<p>This article presents “official statistics in development”. This means they are subject to revision, and may change in the future following user feedback.</p><p>Further information is included in the <a href=\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/employmentandemployeetypes/methodologies/measuringlabourdemandvolumesacrosstheukusingtextkerneldatauserguide\">accompanying user guide.</a></p>"},{"type":"Header","title":"Job adverts in Preston","label":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts. All London local authorities are combined. "},{"type":"Summary","title":"In Preston:","sections":[{"indicator":"Job adverts","value":"7.1","note":"","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in Preston was above the UK average. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#job_adverts\">More about job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Skills","value":"51%","note":"","content":"<p>In Lancashire, an average proportion of adverts in 2023 could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#skills\">More about skills</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Health","value":"50%","note":"","content":"<p>A lower proportion of health and social care job adverts in Lancashire could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#health\">More about health and social care job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"}]},{"id":"job_adverts","type":"Section","title":"In August 2024, there were more online job adverts than the UK average in Preston","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in Preston rose to 7.0 per 100 working-age residents (aged 16 to 64 years), from 5.2 adverts in August 2023. </p><p>This was higher than the UK average of 3.4 adverts per 100 working-age residents in August 2024. </p>"},{"id":"linechart","type":"Chart","chartType":"line","title":"Trends in job adverts","subtitle":"Trends in job adverts per 100 working-age residents in Preston, June 2017 to August 2024","footer":"Source: Textkernel, Office for National Statistics","data":[{"z":"Preston","x":"2017-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.205924474},{"z":"Preston","x":"2017-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.439371588},{"z":"Preston","x":"2017-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.374172221},{"z":"Preston","x":"2017-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.252495451},{"z":"Preston","x":"2017-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":3.965155219},{"z":"Preston","x":"2017-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":3.777094617},{"z":"Preston","x":"2017-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":3.537240629},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":3.839582192},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":3.833940488},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":3.720300461},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.295861676},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-04-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.112801831},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.14853262},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.313055439},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.213546536},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.336481941},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":4.606047906},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.706792611},{"z":"Preston","x":"2018-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.091685741},{"z":"Preston","x":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.096819968},{"z":"Preston","x":"2019-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.258839601},{"z":"Preston","x":"2019-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":4.411381614},{"z":"Preston","x":"201